findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled with splash/debris:
A) shelving used for sushi supply storage at the bar;
B) bottom inside warmer in kitchen area;
C) chicken freezer - 1. bottom inside and 2. handles;
D) table holding mixer;
E) table holding Turbo-chef ovens;  and
F) blue storage tubs used for gravy and other items in dry storage area.
Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
